text:
I can make the demo login with a username box only, because I never put a password box in a form. When a real step needs a password, the app asks for it in its own secret box.

```a2ui
{"createSurface":{"surfaceId":"s1","catalogId":"foo.kit.v1"}}
{"updateComponents":{"surfaceId":"s1","components":[{"id":"root","component":"ShortForm","fields":[{"name":"username","label":"Username","type":"text"}],"action":{"event":{"name":"demo_login","context":{}}}}]}}
```
